Package: WSSmod
Title: Weighted Sum of Scores for Protein Network Modules
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Robert", "Butler", , "rrbutler@stanford.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0200-8682")),
    person("WSSmod authors", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Computes Weighted Sum of Scores (WSS) module-level summaries from
    proteomic data. Protein-level values are sign-aligned to their association
    with core biomarkers and combined within 'STRING' network modules, weighted
    by network connectivity and association strength. Bundled reference modules
    and a fitted 'joinet' model also allow all module scores to be predicted
    from age, sex and a small panel of plasma biomarkers, without measuring the
    full proteomic panel.
